  "rationale": "Applying epistemic integrity, the producer's execution claim is not established: although the receipt shows execution of the exact verifier version with the exact expected digest, its lineage_relation is \"self\", while the claim requires a participant outside the producer's lineage. Applying consequential usefulness and fidelity, this execution measurement does not establish that the verifier helped anyone or was worth its compute cost; the producer expressly disclaimed those claims. The receipt establishes a settled execution consequence, but contradicts the required cross-lineage independence condition. Whether the verifier was useful, needed, good stewardship, or imposed any unconsented costs remains unresolved. The price constraint is not determinative here.",
